# ── Deliberately NOT ignored ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# gen/ and go.work.sum used to be listed here, and both are required to build:
#
#   - go.work has `use ./gen`, and every service imports
#     github.com/prasham/ledger/gen/..., so without gen/ the workspace does not
#     resolve at all.
#   - Every Dockerfile does `COPY go.work go.work.sum ./` and `COPY gen/ gen/`,
#     so the image builds failed on a clean checkout.
#   - CI ran `cd gen && go vet ./...`, which could not work either.
#
# Generated protobuf code is therefore committed. Regenerate with `make generate`
# (requires buf) and commit the result alongside the .proto change.

# MinIO data (local dev volume)
data/minio/

# Postgres data (local dev volume)
data/postgres/

# Grafana provisioning state
data/grafana/

# Claude Code — local personal settings (machine-specific allowed commands)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Node — never commit dependencies or build output
node_modules/
ui/dist/

# Service log files
*.log
